          "item_key": "ES2011d#0",
          "type": "problems",
          "text": "Locator button integration is not yet designed; how the button attaches to the locator remains undefined, and coordination between the locator and the beeper is not yet designed and requires integration work."
        },
        {
          "item_key": "ES2011d#1",
          "type": "problems",
          "text": "There is ambiguity about the scoring method for the evaluation, specifically whether to sum the scores and divide by four."
        },
        {
          "item_key": "ES2011d#2",
          "type": "problems",
          "text": "Compatibility issues with WordPerfect and reliance on old disks may hamper access to documents."
        },
        {
          "item_key": "ES2011d#3",
          "type": "decisions",
          "text": "We decided on batteries as the power source for the remote."
        },
        {
          "item_key": "ES2011d#4",
          "type": "decisions",
          "text": "We decided that a regular chip would be necessary for the more advanced iPod-like button."
        },
        {
          "item_key": "ES2011d#5",
          "type": "decisions",
          "text": "We will develop a variety of trendy fruit designs for the remote control."
        },
